# Canonical host is the apex domain, which is what the Cloud Run mapping and
# index.html's <link rel="canonical"> both use. This file previously sent
# buildmybot.app -> www.buildmybot.app, which is backwards: www has no DNS
# record, so the rule pointed the only working host at an unreachable one.
# Kept in the reverse direction so a www request still lands somewhere real if
# a www record is added later and traffic reaches a host that reads this file.
https://www.buildmybot.app/* https://buildmybot.app/:splat 301
http://www.buildmybot.app/* https://buildmybot.app/:splat 301

